  "mathematical_findings": [
    "Physical is actual unit-modulus entries plus scalar row orthogonality HH*=6I. Dephased is actual first row and first column equal to one. Maximal compares every increasing row triple and every three-column subset against the original leading corner invariant, with non-strict inequalities allowing ties.",
